  "stimulus": null,
  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">One gallon of stain will cover <math alttext=\"170\"><mn>170</mn>\n</math> square feet of a surface. A yard has a total fence area of <math alttext=\"w\"><mi>w</mi>\n</math><em>&nbsp;</em>square feet. Which equation represents the total amount of stain <math alttext=\"upper S\"><mi>S</mi>\n</math>, in gallons, needed to stain the fence in this yard twice?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [
    {
      "id": "842cc8ca-2a07-43cb-9b2c-ed4bfba34954",
      "content": "<p><math alttext=\"upper S equals StartFraction w Over 170 EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>S</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mfrac>\n\t\t\t<mi>w</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>170</mn>\n\t\t</mfrac>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"
    },
    {
